/T (metadata needed by a cloud file-storage service. The Users, Folders, Files, FileVersions, ShareLinks, and ActivityLogs tables represent ownership, folder structure, file details, version history, sharing, and activity. The SQL queries report active storage usage, storage by user, file-type counts, large files, recent uploads, and share-link status. This project is suitable as a beginner-level DBMS mini project and can be expanded into a complete cloud-enabled application.)
